  {
   "key": "pp-when",
   "title": "Present Perfect · when do we use it? (life experiences)",
   "tags": {
    "content": [
     "Present Perfect"
    ],
    "levels": [
     "A2"
    ],
    "skills": [
     "Leitura"
    ]
   },
   "block": {
    "type": "explanation",
    "label": "WHEN DO WE USE IT? · LIFE EXPERIENCES",
    "html": "Something happened <b>in your life</b>, at some time <b>until now</b>.<br><b>When?</b> It is not important, so we <b>don't say</b> it.<br><br><i>I <span style=\"background-color: #CBE4D8\"><b>have</b></span> <span style=\"background-color: #FFDB8F\"><b>visited</b></span> Rio.</i><br><i>She <span style=\"background-color: #FFC9A3\"><b>has</b></span> <span style=\"background-color: #FFDB8F\"><b>eaten</b></span> sushi.</i><br><i>I <span style=\"background-color: #CBE4D8\"><b>have</b></span> <span style=\"background-color: #FFDB8F\"><b>seen</b></span> a whale.</i><br><i>He <span style=\"background-color: #FFC9A3\"><b>has</b></span> <span style=\"background-color: #FFDB8F\"><b>ridden</b></span> a horse.</i><br><i>We <span style=\"background-color: #CBE4D8\"><b>have</b></span> <span style=\"background-color: #FFDB8F\"><b>met</b></span> a famous person.</i><br><br>💡 <b>been to</b> = visited: <i>I <span style=\"background-color: #CBE4D8\"><b>have</b></span> <span style=\"background-color: #FFDB8F\"><b>been</b></span> to Bahia.</i> (= I have visited Bahia)<br>💡 How many times? <b>once</b> (1×) · <b>twice</b> (2×) · <b>three times</b> · <b>many times</b><br><i>I <span style=\"background-color: #CBE4D8\"><b>have</b></span> <span style=\"background-color: #FFDB8F\"><b>visited</b></span> Rio <b>twice</b>. · She <span style=\"background-color: #FFC9A3\"><b>has</b></span> <span style=\"background-color: #FFDB8F\"><b>flown</b></span> in a plane <b>many times</b>.</i>"
   }
  },
